// Reborn Level 1 1 - Heavensward Level 1 2 - Heavensward Level 2 3 - Heavensward Level 3 4 - A Realm
// Reborn Elite 5 - Heavensward Elite 6 - Stormblood Level 1 7 - Stormblood Level 2 8 - Stormblood
// Level 3 9 - Stormblood Elite 10 - Shadowbringers Level 1 11 - Shadowbringers Level 2 12 -
// Shadowbringers Level 3 13 - Shadowbringers Elite 14 - Endwalker Level 1 15 - Endwalker Level 2 16 -
// Endwalker Level 3 17 - Endwalker Elite 18 - Dawntrail Level 1 19 - Dawntrail Level 2 20 - Dawntrail
// Level 3 21 - Dawntrail Elite
